Feature: Background Steps
  Testing that Background steps run before each scenario

  Image: alpine:latest

  Background:
    Given a file "shared.txt" with content:
      shared content
    Given I run "cp shared.txt shared-copy.txt"

  Scenario: First scenario sees background file
    When I run "cat shared.txt"
    Then exit code is 0
    Then output contains "shared content"

  Scenario: Second scenario also sees background file
    When I run "cat shared.txt"
    Then exit code is 0
    Then file "shared.txt" exists

  Scenario: Background setup commands also run
    When I run "cat shared-copy.txt"
    Then exit code is 0
    Then output contains "shared content"
